{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43381","headline":"寄故姬 · 江陵士子","name":"寄故姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴云羃羃下阳台，惹着襄王更不回。\n五度看花空有泪，一心如结不曾开。\n纤萝自合依芳树，覆水宁思返旧杯。\n惆怅高丽坡底宅，春光无复下山来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江陵士子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}